--carbon mui-eadae1 mr-text-align-skip" id=":rf:" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10 16L20 6l1.4 1.4l-8.6 8.6l8.6 8.6L20 26z" class="mr-text-align-skip"></path></svg><span class="MuiTouchRipple-root mui-w0pj6f mr-text-align-skip"></span></button></div><nav class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 MuiBreadcrumbs-root mui-1ai6zi6" aria-label="breadcrumb"><ol class="MuiBreadcrumbs-ol mui-nhb8h9"><li class="MuiBreadcrumbs-li"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-1l3ld7t"><span class="MuiBox-root mui-0">Inquire &amp; Pay</span></p></li></ol></nav></div></div><div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-0"><div class="MuiDrawer-root MuiDrawer-docked mui-gcvn1e" id="test"><div class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-elevation0 MuiDrawer-paper MuiDrawer-paperAnchorRight MuiDrawer-paperAnchorDockedRight mui-ah63mc" style="transform: translateX(375px); visibility: hidden;"><div class="service-info-dialog "><div class="service-info-dialog-header"><div class="sin-service-section undefined"><div class="sin-top-icon"><div class="service-icon-2 "><img data-savepage-src="https://www.dubaipolice.gov.ae/dpcms/cmsUploads/Fines_Inquiry_and_Payment_bc442f6ecd.svg" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt=""></div></div><div class="sin-desc"><div class="font-secondary font-bold">Fines Inquiry and Payment</div></div></div><div class="serv-det-btn-close"><button class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiIconButton-root MuiIconButton-sizeMedium mui-15mydm5" tabindex="0" type="button" aria-label="Close"><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium mui-14yq2cq mr-text-align-skip" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" data-testid="CloseIcon"><path d="M19 6.41 17.59 5 12 10.59 6.41 5 5 6.41 10.59 12 5 17.59 6.41 19 12 13.41 17.59 19 19 17.59 13.41 12z" class="mr-text-align-skip"></path></svg><span class="MuiTouchRipple-root mui-w0pj6f mr-text-align-skip"></span></button></div></div><div class="service-info-dialog-content"><div class="service-det-fees-sect"><div class="sin-fees-info info-box"><span class="info-label">Fees</span><span class="info-value">Required<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" aria-hidden="true" role="img" class="iconify iconify--eva ml-1 mui-eadae1" id=":rg:" font-size="small" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 10 10A10 10 0 0 0 12 2m0 18a8 8 0 1 1 8-8a8 8 0 0 1-8 8"></path><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="1" fill="currentColor"></circle><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 10a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v5a1 1 0 0 0 2 0v-5a1 1 0 0 0-1-1"></path></svg></span><span class="info-sub">AED</span></div><div class="sin-duration-info info-box"><span class="info-label">Duration</span><span class="info-value !line-height-0 items-center">  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" aria-hidden="true" role="img" class="iconify iconify--eva ml-1 mui-eadae1" id=":rh:" font-size="small" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 10 10A10 10 0 0 0 12 2m0 18a8 8 0 1 1 8-8a8 8 0 0 1-8 8"></path><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="1" fill="currentColor"></circle><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 10a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v5a1 1 0 0 0 2 0v-5a1 1 0 0 0-1-1"></path></svg></span><span class="info-label"> Instant</span></div></div><div class="expandable-text-container MuiBox-root mui-0"><div class="expandable-text mb-6"><p>A service to inquire about traffic violations, including the following:<br>
•	<strong>Traffic Fines Payment</strong>: A service that enables the settlement of traffic violations registered against a vehicle plate, driving licence, or traffic code.<br>
•	 <strong>Traffic Fines Instalments</strong>: A service that allows for the payment of traffic violations in monthly instalments via direct debit or credit card, subject to applicable terms and conditions.<br>
•	<strong>Pay Against Impound</strong>: A service that allows for the payment of a daily fee to waive a vehicle’s impoundment period, provided no legal restrictions apply.<br>
•	<strong>Smart Impound</strong>: A service that allows a vehicle to be kept at a designated private location during an impoundment period using a smart device linked to the operations centre, with movement permitted only in emergencies.<br>
•	<strong>Black Points Transfer</strong>: A service that enables the transfer of black points from a vehicle’s record to a driver’s record, thereby allowing the fine to be settled.<br>
•	<strong>Violation Review</strong>: A service that allows for a formal request to review a traffic violation and reassess the accuracy of the recorded details.<br>
•	<strong>Violation Evidence Images</strong>: A service that enables the viewing of radar-captured images provided as evidence for traffic violations issued against their record.<br>
•	<strong>Traffic Fines Statement Dispatch</strong>: A service that enables the provision of a comprehensive statement of traffic violations to a specified email address.</p></div></div><div class="service-detail-info"><div class="service-detail-info-head"><div class="service-detail-info-icon"><span class="mr-[8px]"><img data-savepage-currentsrc="https://www.dubaipolice.gov.ae/app/img/dpServiceInfoIcons/service-fees.svg" data-savepage-src="/app/img/dpServiceInfoIcons/service-fees.svg" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt="Working Hours"></span></div><div class="service-detail-info-title font-[500]">Service Fees</div></div><div class="service-detail-info-body"><div class="service-card-row"><div>Amount depends on the fines issued</div><div><span class="font-[500]"></span></div></div><div class="service-card-row"><div> knowledge fee (per violation)</div><div><span class="font-[500]">10 AED</span></div></div><div class="service-card-row"><div>innovation fee (per violation)</div><div><span class="font-[500]">10 AED</span></div></div></div></div><div class="service-detail-info"><div class="service-detail-info-head mb-1"><div class="service-detail-info-icon"><span class="mr-[8px]"><img data-savepage-currentsrc="https://www.dubaipolice.gov.ae/app/img/dpServiceInfoIcons/paymentCard.svg" data-savepage-src="/app/img/dpServiceInfoIcons/paymentCard.svg" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt="Payment Methods"></span></div><div class="service-detail-info-title font-[500]">Payment Methods</div></div><div class="service-detail-info-body service-detail-payment"><div class="mt-4 pb-4 border-b border-[rgba(196,196,197,0.3)] last:border-b-0 last:pb-0"><div class="pb-3"><div class="text-[14px]">Cash or Debit Card</div><div class="text-[13px]">In service centers and SPS centers</div></div><div class="flex gap-4 "><img data-savepage-currentsrc="https://www.dubaipolice.gov.ae/app/img/payment-methods/cash.svg" data-savepage-src="/app/img/payment-methods/cash.svg" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt="Cash" class="h-8"><img data-savepage-currentsrc="https://www.dubaipolice.gov.ae/app/img/payment-methods/visa.svg" data-savepage-src="/app/img/payment-methods/visa.svg" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt="Debit Card" class="h-8"></div></div><div class="mt-4 pb-4 border-b border-[rgba(196,196,197,0.3)] last:border-b-0 last:pb-0"><div class="pb-3"><div class="text-[14px]">Debit Card or Credit Card</div></div><div class="flex gap-4 "><img data-savepage-currentsrc="https://www.dubaipolice.gov.ae/app/img/payment-methods/mastercard.svg" data-savepage-src="/app/img/payment-methods/mastercard.svg" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt="Credit Card" class="h-8"><img data-savepage-currentsrc="https://www.dubaipolice.gov.ae/app/img/payment-methods/visa.svg" data-savepage-src="/app/img/payment-methods/visa.svg" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt="Debit Card" class="h-8"></div></div><div class="mt-4 pb-4 border-b border-[rgba(196,196,197,0.3)] last:border-b-0 last:pb-0"><div class="pb-3"><div class="text-[14px]">Apple Pay</div></div><div class="flex gap-4 "><img data-savepage-currentsrc="https://www.dubaipolice.gov.ae/app/img/payment-methods/apple.svg" data-savepage-src="/app/img/payment-methods/apple.svg" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt="Apple Pay" class="h-8"></div></div></div></div><div class="service-detail-info"><div class="service-detail-info-head"><div class="service-detail-info-icon"><span class="mr-[8px]"><img data-savepage-currentsrc="https://www.dubaipolice.gov.ae/app/img/dpServiceInfoIcons/beneficiaries.svg" data-savepage-src="/app/img/dpServiceInfoIcons/beneficiaries.svg" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt="Beneficiaries"></span></div><div class="service-detail-info-title block font-[500]">Beneficiaries<br><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-1w97n4k"></span></div></div><div class="service-detail-info-body"><ul class="serv-det-list"><li class=""><i class="dp-icon dp-individual"></i>Individuals</li><li class=""><i class="dp-icon dp-business-sector"></i>Business Sector</li><li class=""><i class="dp-icon dp-governmental-entities"></i>Governmental Entities</li></ul></div></div><div class="service-detail-info"><div class="service-detail-info-head items-start"><div class="service-detail-info-icon"><span class="mr-[8px]"><img data-savepage-currentsrc="https://www.dubaipolice.gov.ae/app/img/dpServiceInfoIcons/accessPoints.svg" data-savepage-src="/app/img/dpServiceInfoIcons/accessPoints.svg" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt="Service Channels"></span></div><div class="service-detail-info-title font-[500] mt-3">Service Channels<br><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-1w97n4k"></span></div></div><div class="service-detail-info-body"><ul class="MuiList-root MuiList-padding serv-det-cha-list mui-1ontqvh"><li class="!p-[7px_0px_7px_28px]"><span><i class="dp-icon-font dp-mobile"></i></span>Dubai Police App</li><li class="!p-[7px_0px_7px_28px]"><span><i class="dp-icon-font dp-desktop"></i></span>Dubai Police Website</li><li class="!p-[7px_0px_7px_28px]"><span><i class="dp-icon dp-901"></i></span>Call Center</li></ul></div></div><div class="service-detail-info"><div class="service-detail-info-head"><div class="service-detail-info-icon"><span class="mr-[8px]"><img data-savepage-currentsrc="https://www.dubaipolice.gov.ae/app/img/dpServiceInfoIcons/workingHours.svg" data-savepage-src="/app/img/dpServiceInfoIcons/workingHours.svg" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt="Working Hours"></span></div><div class="service-detail-info-title font-[500]">Working Hours<br><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-1w97n4k"></span></div></div><div class="service-detail-info-body"><div class="service-card-row"><div><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 !text-[14px] mui-jt9sz7">Digital Channels</span></div><div><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 !font-[500] !text-[14px] mui-jt9sz7">24/7</span></div></div><div class="service-card-row"><div><span class="Mu